<h1>hVmark Demo</h1>

&I can write *in bold* and /in italics/.&
I can -strike things out- and _underline_ them, while simultaneously \*showing how it's done\*.
`echo 'I can also output some code.';`
And I can still do <strong>everything the hard way</strong>, but <em>why would you wanna do that?</em>

Line breaks are automatic, []except for when they're not.

<p style="display:none">You could override the line generator entirely and do some nifty tricks, like hiding messages in plain sight.</p>

